n the face of strong opposition.","required":true},{"id":"via.bravery.02","text":"Don't hesitate to express an unpopular opinion.","required":true},{"id":"via.bravery.03","text":"Do not stand up for my beliefs.","required":true},{"id":"via.bravery.04","text":"Don't speak my mind freely when there might be negative results.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_capacity_for_love_4.01","text":"Know that there are people in my life who care as much for me as for themselves.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_capacity_for_love_4.02","text":"Can express love to someone else.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_capacity_for_love_4.03","text":"Do not easily share my feelings with others.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_capacity_for_love_4.04","text":"Have difficulty accepting love from anyone.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_creativity_4.01","text":"Come up with new ways to do things.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_creativity_4.02","text":"Am an original thinker.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_creativity_4.03","text":"Am not considered to have new and different ideas.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_creativity_4.04","text":"Have no special urge to do something original.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_curiosity_4.01","text":"Am excited by many different activities.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_curiosity_4.02","text":"Can find something of interest in any situation.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_curiosity_4.03","text":"Am not all that curious about the world.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_curiosity_4.04","text":"Have few interests.","required":true},{"id":"via.fairness.01","text":"Treat all people equally.","required":true},{"id":"via.fairness.02","text":"Believe that everyone's rights are equally important.","required":true},{"id":"via.fairness.03","text":"Take advantage of others.","required":true},{"id":"via.fairness.04","text":"Treat others differently if I don't like them.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_forgiveness_4.01","text":"Try to respond with understanding when someone treats me badly.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_forgiveness_4.02","text":"Allow others to make a fresh start.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_forgiveness_4.03","text":"Hold grudges.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_forgiveness_4.04","text":"Find it hard to forgive others.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_gratitude_4.01","text":"Express my thanks to those who care about me.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_gratitude_4.02","text":"Am an extremely grateful person.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_gratitude_4.03","text":"Feel no gratitude to others.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_gratitude_4.04","text":"Find few things in my life to be grateful for.","required":true},{"id":"via.honesty.01","text":"Am trusted to keep secrets.","required":true},{"id":"via.honesty.02","text":"Keep my promises.","required":true},{"id":"via.honesty.03","text":"Lie to get myself out of trouble.","required":true},{"id":"via.honesty.04","text":"Cheat on people who have trusted me.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_hope_4.01","text":"Can find the positive in what seems negative to others.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_hope_4.02","text":"Remain hopeful despite challenges.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_hope_4.03","text":"Expect the worst.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_hope_4.04","text":"Often think about the possibility of negative outcomes that are not likely to occur.","required":true},{"id":"via.humility.01","text":"Don't brag about my accomplishments.","required":true},{"id":"via.humility.02","text":"Would never be described as arrogant.","required":true},{"id":"via.humility.03","text":"Like to stand out in a crowd.","required":true},{"id":"via.humility.04","text":"Like to talk about myself.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_humor_4.01","text":"Use laughter to brighten the days of others.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_humor_4.02","text":"Keep my sense of humor even in gloomy situations.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_humor_4.03","text":"Am not known for my sense of humor.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_humor_4.04","text":"Am not fun to be with.","required":true},{"id":"via.judgment.01","text":"Weigh the pro's and the con's.","required":true},{"id":"via.judgment.02","text":"Am valued by my friends for my good judgment.","required":true},{"id":"via.judgment.03","text":"Don't tend to think things through critically.","required":true},{"id":"via.judgment.04","text":"Don't think about different possibilities when making decisions.","required":true},{"id":"via.kindness.01","text":"Am never too busy to help a friend.","required":true},{"id":"via.kindness.02","text":"Go out of my way to cheer up people who appear down.","required":true},{"id":"via.kindness.03","text":"Get impatient when others talk to me about their problems.","required":true},{"id":"via.kindness.04","text":"Am only kind to others if they have been kind to me.","required":true},{"id":"via.leadership.01","text":"Am good at helping people work well together.","required":true},{"id":"via.leadership.02","text":"Am told that I am a strong but fair leader.","required":true},{"id":"via.leadership.03","text":"Have difficulty getting others to work together.","required":true},{"id":"via.leadership.04","text":"Am not good at taking charge of a group.","required":true},{"id":"via.love_of_learning.01","text":"Am a true life-long learner.","required":true},{"id":"via.love_of_learning.02","text":"Am thrilled when I learn something new.","required":true},{"id":"via.love_of_learning.03","text":"Don't like to learn new things.","required":true},{"id":"via.love_of_learning.04","text":"Don't read nonfiction books for fun.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_perseverance_4.01","text":"Don't quit a task before it is finished.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_perseverance_4.02","text":"Finish things despite obstacles in the way.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_perseverance_4.03","text":"Don't finish what I start.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_perseverance_4.04","text":"Give up easily.","required":true},{"id":"via.perspective.01","text":"Have a mature view on life.","required":true},{"id":"via.perspective.02","text":"Am considered to be a wise person.","required":true},{"id":"via.perspective.03","text":"Am not good at figuring out what really matters.","required":true},{"id":"via.perspective.04","text":"Am rarely consulted for advice by others.","required":true},{"id":"via.prudence.01","text":"Believe it is always better to be safe than sorry","required":true},{"id":"via.prudence.02","text":"Make careful choices.","required":true},{"id":"via.prudence.03","text":"Act before thinking through the consequences.","required":true},{"id":"via.prudence.04","text":"Like taking risks.","required":true},{"id":"via.self_regulation.01","text":"Am a highly disciplined person.","required":true},{"id":"via.self_regulation.02","text":"Forego things that are bad for me in the long run even if they make me feel good in the short run.","required":true},{"id":"via.self_regulation.03","text":"Let myself be taken over by urges to spend or eat too much.","required":true},{"id":"via.self_regulation.04","text":"Give in to my urges.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_social_intelligence_4.01","text":"Am good at sensing what others are feeling.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_social_intelligence_4.02","text":"Know what to say to make people feel good.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_social_intelligence_4.03","text":"Don't know how to handle myself in a new social situation.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_social_intelligence_4.04","text":"Have trouble guessing how others will react.","required":true},{"id":"via.spirituality.01","text":"Am a spiritual person.","required":true},{"id":"via.spirituality.02","text":"Believe that each person has a purpose in life.","required":true},{"id":"via.spirituality.03","text":"Feel that life has no meaning.","required":true},{"id":"via.spirituality.04","text":"Do not believe in a universal power or a God.","required":true},{"id":"via.teamwork.01","text":"Am an extremely loyal person.","required":true},{"id":"via.teamwork.02","text":"Support my teammates or fellow group members.","required":true},{"id":"via.teamwork.03","text":"Am not good at working with a group.","required":true},{"id":"via.teamwork.04","text":"Prefer to do everything alone.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_zest_4.01","text":"Awaken with a sense of excitement about the day's possibilities.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_zest_4.02","text":"Look forward to each new day.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_zest_4.03","text":"Am described as grumpy.","required":true},{"id":"viar.ipip_via_r_zest_4.04","text":"Don't have much energy.","required":true}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":null,"contentHash":"sha256:34ea675fe4539c8052bc80c8ec65e65669b98693ec2c450ab70e7c4611d3c37e"}]
$hh_via96$::jsonb) loop
    if exists (select 1 from app.assessment_versions where id=(d->>'id')::uuid and content_hash<>d->>'contentHash') then
      raise exception 'Conflicting IPIP-VIA-R-96 ID %',d->>'id';
    end if;
    if exists (select 1 from app.assessment_versions where definition_key=d->>'key' and definition_version=d->>'version' and instrument_locale=d->>'instrumentLocale' and content_hash<>d->>'contentHash') then
      raise exception 'Conflicting IPIP-VIA-R-96 definition %',d->>'key';
    end if;
    insert into app.assessment_versions (id,definition_key,definition_version,instrument_locale,translation_version,definition,questions,answer_schema,scoring_key,scoring_version,result_schema,timeframe,source_metadata,content_hash)
    values ((d->>'id')::uuid,d->>'key',d->>'version',d->>'instrumentLocale',d->>'translationVersion',d,d->'questions',
      jsonb_build_object('type','integer','minimum',(d->'answerScale'->>'min')::int,'maximum',(d->'answerScale'->>'max')::int),
      d->>'scoringKey',d->>'scoringVersion',jsonb_build_object('version',d->>'resultVersion'),d->>'timeframe',d->'source',d->>'contentHash')
    on conflict (id) do nothing;
  end loop;
